> > > >
> > > > where \delta_{i} is the set of area i's neighbors, n_{\delta_{i}} is the number of neighbors.
> > > >
> > > > I define the model in NIMBLE as:
> > > > ####Model specification
> > > > model_code <- nimbleCode( {
> > > >   # Priors
