P_6_MCMC.cpp:1116:59: error: cannot convert 'NimArr<1, double>' to 'double' for argument '2' to 'double Rf_dnbinom(double, double, double, int)'
  llep = dnbinom(Interm_765, (**model_r1), Interm_766, true);
                                                           ^
